a, Jujur, dan Adil), juga diikuti seluruh rakyat Indonesia dengan kedamaian serta kegembiraan.\n\nSaya menekankan kepada seluruh pihak untuk mengikuti mekanisme Pemilu 2024, yang juga mengatur jika terjadi kecurangan dalam proses pelaksanaan. Jika ada kecurangan dapat dilaporkan ke Bawaslu RI, kemudian masih ada mekanisme gugatan lanjutan di MK RI.\n\nSaya yakini, rakyat Indonesia telah menggunakan hak pilihnya dengan sebaik-baiknya. Maka, mari kita bersama-sama menantikan pengumuman hasil resminya.\n\nFoto: Vico - Biro Pers Sekretariat Presiden","image_url":"https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/crawler.img/65cf7fe24ce9965b07e5ff38.jpg","avatar":"https://scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t51.2885-15/323796872_186095804235435_4099239256456033831_n.jpg?_nc_cat=1&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=7d201b&_nc_ohc=4Wt_vdKgk4kAX_-qHTK&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.xx&edm=AL-3X8kEAAAA&oh=00_AfC-C8G0So5_RZyv6Dzy_w4u3oJBMOYjdHRl0BEKM2Dd5w&oe=65DAD12D","content":null,"likes":2494056,"comments":57492,"is_business":true,"clean":true,"album":["https://instagram.fdad3-5.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.29350-15/426743952_388209107232254_4221244758372340405_n.heic?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s1080x1080&_nc_ht=instagram.fdad3-5.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=102&_nc_ohc=ubzwivC6hlMAX9CwiFz&edm=AABBvjUBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfB9Ne7XLN-86A_ZMVcBCWsglzyMHZAIFGWINiewjyGMZQ&oe=6612527C&_nc_sid=4f4799","https://instagram.fdad3-5.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.29350-15/427015659_637589111802991_2106140099726410086_n.heic?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s1080x1080&_nc_ht=instagram.fdad3-5.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=107&_nc_ohc=xDknsdD7r5oAX-72RpW&edm=AABBvjUBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfBQQ-rdycwf9UXKaUYV0khhyubTBObFvTkb2bMxKortnA&oe=66125F76&_nc_sid=4f4799","https://instagram.fdad3-5.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.29350-15/427715197_758385545863650_3586394425271949895_n.heic?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s1080x1080&_nc_ht=instagram.fdad3-5.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=106&_nc_ohc=POFZ3rca5-UAX_Ib3UL&edm=AABBvjUBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfAT9OxgFk6yH-98z5ru0gwqM0RWvwK1oVpniZjr7kq30A&oe=661259F2&_nc_sid=4f4799"],"is_album":true,"albu